	Generic Tetris 1.4

A few changes to 1.3:

(1)     "Daryl Green" <darylg@amex-trs.com> made some modifications to
	let it work on IBM machines running AIX:

	Add	#include <sys/select.h>		in "tetris.h"
	Add	-lbsd				in "Makefile" LDFLAGS

	Or you may pick up 1.4 from export.lcs.mit.edu under /contrib,
	"tetris.1.4.shar.Z"

(2)     People had some problems on OpenWindows. Here I only have
	access to OpenWin 3.0 -- when I ran 'tetris', at first it
	couldn't get input focus; then I iconified it through the
	window manager (pressed the button left to the title bar) and
	deiconified it -- then it could get key inputs. After this I
	tried several times but I never got the problem again... I'll
	try to fix this...

Thanks for all the comments... I have some great ideas on revising the
program, but I have to wait till I get my time back from regular work.

